{"annotations":{"list":[{"builtIn":1,"datasource":{"type":"grafana","uid":"-- Grafana --"},"enable":true,"hide":true,"iconColor":"rgba(0, 211, 255, 1)","name":"Annotations & Alerts","type":"dashboard"},{"name":"gardenio rollout","datasource":{"type":"prometheus","uid":"${DS_PROMETHEUS}"},"enable":true,"hide":false,"iconColor":"semi-dark-orange","expr":"count(changes(process_start_time_seconds{namespace=\"gardenio-system\",component!=\"\"}[$__interval]) > 0) >= 3","step":"1m","titleFormat":"gardenio rollout","textFormat":"3+ gardenio-system components restarted at once - a release deploy or chart apply. Check this marker before hunting a code cause for a step change on this board."},{"name":"component restart","datasource":{"type":"prometheus","uid":"${DS_PROMETHEUS}"},"enable":false,"hide":false,"iconColor":"semi-dark-blue","expr":"changes(process_start_time_seconds{namespace=\"gardenio-system\",component!=\"\"}[$__interval]) > 0","step":"1m","tagKeys":"component","titleFormat":"{{component}} restarted","textFormat":"gardenio-system/{{component}} moved its process start time - deploy, OOM-kill or crash-loop. Off by default: ~22 single-component restarts/day fleet-wide would bury the rollout markers."}]},"description":"Live latency distributions for the five dense _bucket histogram families the GRADE audit (2026-08-16) flagged as the biggest Depth gap: LLM request, tool call, session duration, deferred wait, and semantic search. Each family gets a distribution HEATMAP (y=latency bucket, colour=density) paired with a percentile-FAN (p50/p90/p99 translucent bands) so operators can read both where the mass sits and how the tail spreads. Plus the live authz-denial signal (idea #6). Every expr is grounded against live gardenio-vmsingle. Ship via the grafana-bridge image (dashboards/agent-latency-distribution.json), not UI edits.","editable":true,"fiscalYearStartMonth":0,"graphTooltip":1,"links":[{"title":"All gardenio boards","type":"dashboards","tags":["gardenio"],"asDro